ign="LEFT" maxLines="1">够半亩滩涂吃一个月</Text></Positioned><Positioned left="65" top="368" width="200" height="6"><Container width="200" height="6" color="#E4622C" borderRadius="3"/></Positioned><Positioned left="65" top="404" width="950" height="28.5"><Text fontSize="17" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC" color="#4A6B67" textAlign="LEFT" maxLines="1">候鸟湾的滩涂每月要清理一次互花米草，一台潮位计每季度校准一次。</Text></Positioned><Positioned left="65" top="434" width="950" height="28.5"><Text fontSize="17" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC" color="#4A6B67" textAlign="LEFT" maxLines="1">认养金全额用于这两件事，账目每季度在公众号公示。</Text></Positioned><Positioned left="65" top="480" width="950" height="200"><Container width="950" height="200" color="#FFFFFF" borderRadius="16" boxShadow="0 6 20 #0B3B3A1F"/></Positioned><Positioned left="65" top="480" width="8" height="200"><Container width="8" height="200" color="#E4622C" borderRadius="4"/></Positioned><Positioned left="100" top="514" width="300" height="70"><Text fontSize="52" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC" color="#0B3B3A" fontStyle="BOLD" textAlign="LEFT" maxLines="1">¥30</Text></Positioned><Positioned left="100" top="588" width="300" height="24"><Text fontSize="15" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC" color="#4A6B67" textAlign="LEFT" maxLines="1">/ 每月</Text></Positioned><Positioned left="100" top="620" width="300" height="32"><Text fontSize="22" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC" color="#E4622C" fontStyle="BOLD" textAlign="LEFT" maxLines="1">护滩人</Text></Positioned><Positioned left="385" top="510" width="1" height="98"><Container width="1" height="98" color="#0B3B3A26"/></Positioned><Positioned left="430" top="510" width="555" height="24.7"><Text fontSize="15" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC" color="#4A6B67" textAlign="LEFT" maxLines="1">每月清理 0.5 亩互花米草</Text></Positioned><Positioned left="430" top="536" width="555" height="24.7"><Text fontSize="15" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC" color="#4A6B67" textAlign="LEFT" maxLines="1">季度潮位计校准 1 次</Text></Positioned><Positioned left="430" top="562" width="555"